Error [E0204]: `pair.right` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> move_and_fnmut_lambda_captures_have_exact_lifetimes_and_places_3.jet:9:42
    |
  9 |     both(() -> &pair.right.push(3), pair.right)
    |                                          ^^^^^
 Why: While something is being changed through the write-access marker `&`, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: Pass the write-access marker `&` (`&pair.right`) only once, or copy first with `~pair.right`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
